# Package.resolved IS tracked — but the file Xcode writes lives inside
# the generated NestTalk.xcodeproj (covered by line 1 above), so the
# in-project copy is implicitly ignored. The committed copy lives at
# apple/Package.resolved.checked-in, restored into the generated project
# by scripts/restore-package-resolved.sh before xcodebuild.
*.ipa
*.app
*.dSYM
*.dSYM.zip
*.profraw
*.profdata
